{"ID":"20240314091840-go1851k","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240314091840-go1851k","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240314091840-go1851k\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170339-ic2bwfz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170339-aw24wwz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:47,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240422170339-aw24wwz\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"【阳和汤】\u0026amp;【仙方活命饮】","type":"doc","updated":"20240422170339"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240422170339-ic2bwfz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170339-ic2bwfz","updated":"20240422170339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"阳和汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170339-xw8fhga","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170339-xw8fhga","updated":"20240422170339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"麻黄三钱、炮姜三片、熟地一两、鹿角胶三钱、肉桂三钱"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170339-z3mr8px","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170339-z3mr8px","updated":"20240422170339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们疏忽了，这边在这个中间加个处方。过去我们经方家用的很多的排脓的处方呢，我们叫做阳和汤，这个阳和汤把它加在，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"当发其痈"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，发其痈的处方呢就叫做阳和汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170339-rvnzpna","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170339-rvnzpna","updated":"20240422170339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"阳和汤的处方呢？麻黄3钱，还有炮的生姜，炮姜3片，熟地1两，鹿角胶3钱，肉桂呢3钱，一般来说，我们把肉桂分成三包一钱，比如说这是六碗水煮两碗，那每次服之前呢冲 1 钱的这个肉桂下去，这是我们的阳和汤，专门发热痈用的。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170339-s40heaa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170339-s40heaa","updated":"20240422170339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这是过去一直传下来的是这样子，大家在处方的时候，老师这个鹿角胶...有的人吃素的。其实吃素的人不要介意这个，我们有和尚来我们那边看，他说只要是治病的，没有什么荤素，统统可以吃，这是主持跟我讲的。那这个鹿角胶也很贵，也不容易弄到真品。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170339-rjj9wux","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170339-rjj9wux","updated":"20240422170339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们后面还有些处方可以发脓的，这个只是我写给你看，像这个炮的生姜，我们是生姜在锅子里面干炒、干煸，你作为做菜的人就知道我讲什么，不会做菜的人给你鸡同鸭脚。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"就是油什么都不要放，直接生姜放下去，两边炒炒，变成黑的就是炮姜"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那这个呢如果病人很寒很重的时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"寒重的时候，我们加附子"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，加附子进去。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170339-p3g4lmm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170339-p3g4lmm","updated":"20240422170339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"写下来这个处方的原因呢？是有种病叫做"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"脑疽"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，在脑壳里面化脓了，这个处方要用。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"否则平常痈脓不在脑部的话，还用不到这个处方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"鹿角胶，这个鹿角生在头顶上，是督脉之余"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。为什么我们用鹿角？因为鹿角是督之余，其他动物的督脉长的这样直直的，它的督脉长个角出来，所以它能透到脑部去。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"所以这个阳和汤的最主要的处方，是用到脑脓疡的时候，脑里面化脓的时候使用的"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170339-26s0ufb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170339-26s0ufb","updated":"20240422170339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那老师，你怎么知道他化脓？手摸上去是烫的，已经告诉你啦，对不对？"}]},{"ID":"20240422170339-pbph28b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170339-pbph28b","updated":"20240422170339"}},{"ID":"20240422170339-ibzdbr4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170339-ibzdbr4","updated":"20240422170339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"text strong","TextMarkTextContent":"仙方活命饮"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"font-size: 24px; color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170339-ygbsree","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170339-ygbsree","updated":"20240422170339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"乳香没药各二钱炙甲片五钱皂角刺三钱防风一钱大贝四钱生草二钱归尾二钱生黄芪三钱赤芍三钱银花三钱排脓加白芷"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170339-65dnwq4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170339-65dnwq4","updated":"20240422170339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右药水煎服，即日止痛。脓成自溃，未成即消。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240422170339-wgpoiaf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170339-wgpoiaf","updated":"20240422170339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里呢，补充了一个方剂，诸位可以用这个方剂来做加减。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170339-s514wqz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170339-s514wqz","updated":"20240422170339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"仙方活命饮，这个仙方活命饮过去呢，你也可以用在治疗乳癌上面，效果也很好。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170339-ubh2yvu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170339-ubh2yvu","updated":"20240422170339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"它是把硬块，乳房上有硬块，或者身上有硬块，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"把硬块逼到皮肤表面上，变成脓疡排出来，所以叫做仙方活命饮"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170339-1cpi8i2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170339-1cpi8i2","updated":"20240422170339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那这个，一般来说"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"肿块凹陷下去的都是恶性"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的，突在外面都是良性的，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"你按肿块摸肿块的时候，表面是光滑的，都是良性的，如果像石头一样很硬，表面非常的粗糙的，就是癌症"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那你无所谓它是良还是恶，我们要把它化脓出来的时候，把它往外逼的时候，这是一个很好和处方，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"乳香跟没药这两个是秤不离砣，砣不离秤"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。那临床上的时候，像伤科的，比如说扭伤，外伤有受伤有伤口，我们都乳香、没药，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"能够消炎、镇痛，止痛，没药呢比较着重在止痛上面，乳香呢比较着重在化脓上面"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，像"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"炙甲就是炙鳖甲"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"皂角刺就是发脓疡"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"防风"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"呢..."},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"大贝"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我们可以用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"贝母"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，因为"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一般来说这种脓疡的病都会有痰在里面"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，基本上中医的观念里面认为里面有痰饮，比如说像淋巴肿瘤，这个甲状腺瘤，腮腺炎，或者是任何的硬块，中医过去认为有痰饮在里面，所以我们都会加些去痰的药，像贝母就是，这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当归尾"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"呢，过去讲这个"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当归参"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当归头"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"还有"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"当归尾"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，那个药性不一样，当归尾绝大多数都是用在活血化淤的上面。那你如果说老师开了当归尾到药房去他要怎么抓？他会把当归拿出来，有须须的部分都剥下来给你，然后身体留下来，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"黄芪"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"就是生黄芪，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"赤芍"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"银花"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这种都是活血化淤的，同时收敛伤口的，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"如果要排脓的时候，加白芷，重用白芷"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170339-ykyib6f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170339-ykyib6f","updated":"20240422170339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个处方呢，我们有乳香，没药，灸鳖甲，皂角刺，防风啊，你心里有数就好了。你临床上开处方的时候，比如说你现在碰到这个人在喉咙上面（"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"有脓疡"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"），喉咙是气分的地方，三焦淋巴系统的地方，我们就可以用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"防已"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为主药，把药带到那边去，那如果是乳房上面呢？"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"乳头"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的地方，我们知道乳头是肝经路过的地方，我们就会用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"柴胡"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为主，所以说其它的药还是在一样的在使用，用什么药去导引，就要看他的病灶在那个位置上。基本上原则就是这样。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170339-mgrwesb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170339-mgrwesb","updated":"20240422170339"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"那大家不要担心，后面呢我讲过，我们光碟里面呢，后面有一片，两个小时的讲乳癌怎么治，都是临床上把病人治好的那种处方，诸位可以按照那个处方呢来做加减。"}]},{"ID":"20240422170339-aw24wwz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240422170339-aw24wwz","updated":"20240422170339"}}]}